<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN" data-eh-version="0.1">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>标题与段落</title>
    <script type="application/json" id="eh-meta">{"title":"标题与段落","created":"2026-11-22","tags":["结构"],"theme":"default"}</script>
    <style id="eh-theme">:root{--eh-fg:#222;--eh-bg:#fff}</style>
    <style id="eh-user-style">[data-eh="h3"]{color:#0a6}</style>
    <script id="eh-runtime" src="./.ehtml/runtime.js" defer></script>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main id="eh-doc">
      <h1 data-eh="h1">一级标题 Heading 1</h1>
      <p data-eh="p1">第一段正文。The first paragraph under H1.</p>
      <h2 data-eh="h2">二级标题 Heading 2</h2>
      <p data-eh="p2">第二段正文，包含中英混排 mixed content。</p>
      <h3 data-eh="h3">三级标题 Heading 3</h3>
      <p data-eh="p3">这个标题有用户自定义样式（见 #eh-user-style）。</p>
      <h4 data-eh="h4">四级标题 Heading 4</h4>
      <h5 data-eh="h5">五级标题 Heading 5</h5>
      <h6 data-eh="h6">六级标题 Heading 6</h6>
      <p data-eh="p4">最后一段。Last paragraph.</p>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
